Goal: (and (RW:on car-in-1a seg-out-1b) (RW:on car-in-1b seg-in-1a) (RW:on car-out-1a seg-in-1b) (RW:on car-out-1b seg-out-1a) (W:analyzed car-in-1a) (W:analyzed car-in-1b) (W:analyzed car-out-1a) (W:analyzed car-out-1b))
Metric: (total-cost)
